  "note": "Decoder harnesses on a different part and flow from any published table; absolute figures are not comparable and not offered as corrections. The RANKING property is the finding.",
  "finding": "The placer/router configuration changes not only magnitudes but the ORDER. 21 designs, medians of five seeds per configuration, ties under 3% excluded: 7 pairwise inversions between heap/router1 and heap/router2 -- a router change alone -- and 13 between heap/router1 and sa/router2. The inversions include format-versus-format verdicts of the kind the paper adjudicates: fp8e5m2-vs-tnf16 flips from TNF ahead (594.2/642.7) to fp8 ahead threefold (446.4/148.3), and every one of the seven router-only inversions involves a TNF-family or GFTernary comparison against fp8. A comparison table whose caption does not name the placer and router pins its RANKING to an unstated choice."
}
